From 5b7694743a26584d51d455f508b95cdf3bb1cc16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TimeAndDatePro Agent <agent@timeanddatepro.local>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 03:47:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] fix(tools): restore disclaimer, feedback popover CSS,
 switch to Lucide icons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add missing .disclaimer, .disclaimer-icon, .disclaimer-body,
  .disclaimer-title, .disclaimer-text styles (lavender soft card)
- Add missing .feedback-fab, .feedback-trigger, .feedback-popover,
  .feedback-type, .feedback-textarea, .feedback-input styles
  (popover was rendering unstyled)
- Add .tdp-hero-explore-links styles (RelatedToolsGrid component
  had no CSS, so cards were rendering as plain text)
- Replace emoji icons with Lucide React:
  * DateToWord: Clipboard, Download, Share2, Code
  * FeedbackButton: MessageSquare
- Robustify Download handler:
  * appends newline, appends anchor to body, cleans up
  * shows 'Downloaded .txt' toast confirmation
- Robustify Share handler:
  * uses /en/date-words route, encodeURIComponent on date
  * adds title attributes for tooltips
- FeedbackButton trigger label toggles 'Suggest / Feedback' ↔ 'Close'
---
 src/components/tools/DateToWord.css           | 297 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/components/tools/DateToWord.tsx           |  31 +-
 .../tools/shared/FeedbackButton.tsx           |   7 +-
 3 files changed, 325 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

